WEBVTT

00:10:28.091 --> 00:10:30.827
accept that it's an emotional experience.

00:10:31.794 --> 00:10:34.397
I looked hundreds of people
in the eye and asked,

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:36.833
"What's the biggest emotion
you struggled with

00:10:36.866 --> 00:10:38.735
during your time of change?"

00:10:39.602 --> 00:10:41.070
The number one answer?

00:10:41.104 --> 00:10:42.272
Fear.

00:10:42.272 --> 00:10:44.073
"How am I going to get through this?"

00:10:44.073 --> 00:10:45.675
"How am I going to pay my bills?"

00:10:45.708 --> 00:10:47.877
Number two, sadness.

00:10:47.911 --> 00:10:49.078
"I miss my loved one."

00:10:49.112 --> 00:10:50.914
"I miss being able to walk."

00:10:51.247 --> 00:10:53.016
Number three, shame.

00:10:53.383 --> 00:10:55.351
"I'm ashamed I have to ask for help."

00:10:55.385 --> 00:10:58.288
"I'm ashamed of what I did
when I drank too much."

00:10:59.289 --> 00:11:02.492
Now some of us cope with these emotions
by writing them down.